{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_10007_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:085ad4512fd55ba59f591d0d51b3ff98dd51dd40beb7cc07df2193235b1ad690",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:04e071bbe853345b81a5a1bc581d742b762cf5174f0a55a99fe2f283cc3f754a",
      "text": "顺从心之所向",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17f268d6c1e9dc746603355d41f8b79236c1d4b17e9cfd1d723ce1a4d8e22974",
      "text": "Altessimo接到了来自某档音乐节目的出演邀约。\n然而节目组提出的企划，却是希望他们演唱\n人气艺人的热门歌曲。两人提出希望能演唱新歌，\n却未能得到采纳……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_a:cmd-000014:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bd711a0c587f0c078d13f61396e0634340adf4afbcabad0ac20aea8f2b2a191",
      "text": "序章",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_a:cmd-000014:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:04e071bbe853345b81a5a1bc581d742b762cf5174f0a55a99fe2f283cc3f754a",
      "text": "顺从心之所向",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_a:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53ff8edc81615aa49f35678131b156517eb18361936acbbe926d0b02c6c218c0",
      "text": "圭先生、丽先生。\n这是新歌的Demo和歌词。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_a:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d8c5db142a33cea307a63a64e213d796edd71a55e6367f1a8f76f5ac094fe941",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，谢谢你。\n我一直很期待呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_a:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9268a259a0a18736d99f63bf91661cff0774adde6fde8b53981baca8cd1b3e01",
      "text": "那么，事不宜迟，请放给我们听听吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_a:cmd-000053:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94c47e71a7f809652716c93dcac4901345742e2813115851d14db6b4d4bcc329",
      "text": "几分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_a:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e7781be5b33781cd63f21d78f272becdecf2c35854e882c9551835d002a5482",
      "text": "这就是我们的新歌……\n歌词和旋律都非常出色呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_a:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76c54e2ceb1571e9a8ada6568a814b4878c62556f20752569d8570e397a4f1ac",
      "text": "嗯。仿佛在温柔地推着人向前……\n是一首兼具温柔与力量的乐曲。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_a:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e9f02056b799b08eb29296a5d8682d07352ec3a83247e46ad8c189028ab12bdd",
      "text": "和丽先生一起唱的话，会交织出怎样的和声\n呢？真想快点听听看啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_a:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b6717d76069ee22bc893230c430656f10a8f3e7afa6d3f05e46e83c0fd4783a8",
      "text": "是的，我也一样。若有都筑先生的歌声相伴，\n这份音乐的美妙定能愈加动人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_a:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e78dc540be48cd07fb8d3ef5791c0938a429a16fbb2a53347a5360e269245549",
      "text": "……真期待它完成的那一刻。\n而且，我想把它传递给渴望这份音乐的人们。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_a:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6dfa83c4e1b36a2ec3429b37e93d84b0be376b22bfffe0e101fb53502fada89a",
      "text": "嗯，我也怀着同样的心情。\n结果马上就收到了工作邀约。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_a:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e323fc2d20c682b66d8d2210ed1d94b7ca766e54e969bf1d1dd0120abbecd7aa",
      "text": "对方先叫我们去开个碰头会，\n我们带上新歌的资料过去吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_b:cmd-000014:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3dd417c988b3477eb5364a80c68f530661f641c54597f23ac7f80fb42d5c8af5",
      "text": "碰头会当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_b:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fccf3599298005c82ff64cd4de57d38dddb80772af92655440327326a0443261",
      "text": "……总而言之呢，就是希望Altessimo能来上我们的\n歌唱节目唱两首。曲目是这几首！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_b:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6371c880bf2be3bfa0ecc0d0977d61171dedfdd664552edcbac5a478b7a3a508",
      "text": "这是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_b:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f58021fa92f31714f0cc31466f32d9fa166dcaec2afb9e725f90e9407539d84",
      "text": "（《The 1st Movement》，和人气艺人的热门歌曲卡拉OK？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_b:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3cf4a08bb4c749673187b6c5988969afd6304647ab67a078c940e405db011b8c",
      "text": "（选《The 1st Movement》是看中知名度吧。\n但是，另一首是……？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_b:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb14df767a3d8073fe072e4d82fd2dd7738e09b9737a96e17688419f3db3cf10",
      "text": "恕我冒昧，这里面没有我们的新歌。\n不能让我们演唱那一首吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_b:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7adc8abc8f83ddd2caf25d2f5735402bacff624e887e4b608ae95b8d213a5d59",
      "text": "新歌也是非常优秀的作品。\n请务必让我们在贵节目中演唱。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_b:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:49ee5aeb1c01d405d1438e79cca8f7042fec602b51dc4977350bf78c75bb0cac",
      "text": "嗯，CD也带来了。\n阁下，请把那份资料拿出来……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_b:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b327c6992e482cc13be77c83fddc19a166b641ff66ec5f664ed2558e5d3858eb",
      "text": "……我说啊～，你们听好了好吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_b:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:22fb332b5f17f8695052b4c80121758a4468a8eff357a98a3e48f19b9540cb9e",
      "text": "观众想听的可不是听都没听过、不知道是什么的歌，\n而是“经典的当红歌曲”啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_c:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25236e739ee3a7354ea8a647d8098028998b1418b7ce7fdb68681f06721a4b61",
      "text": "再说了，万一那首新歌冷场了怎么办？\n节目花掉的经费和时间，你们能负得起责吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_c:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5867b35d0f11ddf5a2a45651e0683b62483039bd1bb37a6ababcbf2121d26ff4",
      "text": "这……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_c:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:035814b4fc2096919b658eaf45d6e6c3d252b1f10a22fc3e64bc2666c5133a88",
      "text": "唱人气艺人的歌，想看Altessimo出场的观众\n不也能变多么！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_c:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7525bc766f386d2aaeba3fcdb1375da36dcc3cf7f6221a095a8e7756bd656f0c",
      "text": "这样一来，你们的知名度不也打响了吗？\n对双方来说皆大欢喜嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_c:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cec2198ee2a9924610489119fcf61d2b2ccf5796afe8e7704b12bbbc90a7e514",
      "text": "（确实，这样一来我们的身影能被更多人看到。\n但是……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_c:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:250e79724f248baebad71f7a196e66b782048d75a2d1e336bbb9578809da71d7",
      "text": "（传进大家耳中、映在大家眼帘里的……\n真的是我们Altessimo吗？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_c:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c26396b09b4f7532fda5340b0a6a7cf6feb7ee2027af79e2e8dc78fbc261112e",
      "text": "丽先生……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_c:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:911f788bfed0f1b50e080d3491b43ab43faeb2b47a99d128b04f3d2750e63e5d",
      "text": "就是这么回事啦，明白了吧！\n那就拜托……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_c:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:668791f096e841887880ac875020f68466ff4a6af0eedae7390c631df552e1f7",
      "text": "……非常抱歉，关于这件事，\n我们改日再给您正式答复。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_c:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62c4554e0f7a3fb75a2fb069f084bfd3108c3af1cb476fa757b8eca97d281f87",
      "text": "今天我们就先告辞了。\n……圭先生、丽先生，我们先出去吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_d:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:71eeb04fb25293169949539c1f02a25f7bd5e103a44f7e5f1790210029a3bcc5",
      "text": "阁下……这样好吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_d:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1bcbd10c230d5ab9111c105b56683799ae329c3f9f8002af097e514f30816c4",
      "text": "要想成为我们所追求的顶尖偶像，\n应该参加这个节目才对吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_d:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cb5310097e1b2a5d9a27088ec87c8a3e3370ec66e49028ad461c225a1d8b4b70",
      "text": "我也很清楚应该这么做。\n放弃新歌，听从他的指示才是正确的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_d:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d752e6a3f62eb94c3ab7de83f1ac83b85ed8f3e17e0ac6af1a954abe8793b76e",
      "text": "（但是，那……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_d:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:451ce7b071b9619476b4dd65193ffe8577c47a8d3ac422ddc5430a9bc93a0a38",
      "text": "丽先生。最重要的，是让大家听到\n属于Altessimo真正的音乐！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_d:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0c2e88cd3eeef089dbda4fc601c0182358d971e6e4ebcda8fec5b83545a8b811",
      "text": "真正的、音乐……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_d:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a29f1b2f3413c9ac0a3fe22dc18689a536b491b0c96614da2deff1fc27be52a6",
      "text": "是啊，丽先生。\n拿到新歌的时候，我从心底里就在想。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_d:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:482583bca12530759d32fbb88607060f72f00a216c3a5bf546b2c434c45a9fb4",
      "text": "啊，真想快点和丽先生一起演唱啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_d:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b49ebf385bca6a98624541cb5fcb2857f95e0f04fdc2106345f3664744ff565e",
      "text": "……我想听你顺从心之所向、\n由心奏响的音乐。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_d:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e8a8ea883e70730ccb0ea70f5c2e59d17816bb6974a3c210d017bc19d084c314",
      "text": "呐，丽先生。丽先生的心，想要歌唱什么呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_d:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56187445906b29d2df7aa7ba12ae2eb342a0c20ee157582d6e3fad9754d013c2",
      "text": "我……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_e:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ea1570c664750a9b2fca14bfa0f7e3a5701178c054c23f3f7b54a4707cf2921",
      "text": "我想唱这首歌。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_e:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9d6e564ae64565ad6519cde43a1ed19841d43cb5757b6a3ddb1c2ff5866fbea",
      "text": "而且，我倾注了心血的音乐，\n在这世界上定会有人倾听……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_e:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f043fc1b1912a2016b3207cc79cc94d2e2daeb1c2cd4685a80413f5d79920d5",
      "text": "我想再一次，去相信这一点。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_e:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9807905801f50133d43d9ecd702518633638d9501e04f72ebef5b7161377172a",
      "text": "……嗯。\n渴望我们音乐的人，一定存在的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_e:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7e8b6ea302bbd5a8067fdb3f9314dd465e28dc25b0cfcaf49eafcb81569e0220",
      "text": "舞台不一定非得是这里。只要有我们在，\n无论哪里都能成为舞台。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_e:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2454c47d222bd5ce5f4d18f57a45012fc3a5dd3f6a18df9ea17e8580d370f5a5",
      "text": "那么，这次的节目出演我们就推掉吧。\n我现在就去寻找能订下的场地！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_e:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c42bab13b889cf2d37b70a9d384e5dfceb59efd49b884c9d0f6b6848eb6e4d13",
      "text": "谢谢你，●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_e:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3e1fb118564b1ee2392ceec0e709ff8092a3d96aa7b757c15e6eac6469c8a11e",
      "text": "……给阁下添麻烦了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_e:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:81a7f6cff7ce722da0a7dc967aec19c05f238f32b234875a2a0a84bea3a8276c",
      "text": "不，没关系的。我一定会找到舞台，\n所以请尽情演唱Altessimo的新歌吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_e:cmd-000068:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:188c35d7729d74913c5e131fc78f59cc3fe1803a539dbc1f794d40a1f9c7a1e4",
      "text": "演出当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_e:cmd-000082:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34cf425f823af8ba699d8848f8f536bc06953576274723eb285e39f6d4902123",
      "text": "早上好，●●●●プロデューサー。\n你已经起来了吗……？突然联络你真不好意思。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_e:cmd-000084:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5a71e85a3edbada6995f0dd26502a0250a03afa368d1abee690aac32d5c8253",
      "text": "今天的集合时间很早对吧？丽先生说，\n很担心我能不能起得来……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_e:cmd-000086:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:46ec7b474fe3788d77951c70f8ff0e31880a9d979df0dfa599643c1b30dbe308",
      "text": "所以我就联络你，告诉你我好好起来了哦。\n呼啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_e:cmd-000088:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8aba27ba242349c8c28cc190c978b888c2426448c44eb3b9550bd07775506ced",
      "text": "……终于能唱新歌了呢。\n定下演出的时候，丽先生看起来好开心啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_e:cmd-000090:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:30b31b94e7b6cea5cce9d52db25911e41913b16678a160ee64a1ac75e8c31332",
      "text": "啊，当然我也很开心哦。\n我一直非常期待今天。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_e:cmd-000092:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d34f719c421b40c4ab9486b071c573346b413eda16626243ae45fa38d768dbd",
      "text": "能举办演出\n我也很高兴",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_e:cmd-000093:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa37ad05c43e50421e965b081c41a51589783a3a14a140cadc735d1bea8fdffd",
      "text": "能找到舞台\n真是太好了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_e:cmd-000096:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df86625ee0044057c09770e49c9e0d83e27ec69eb0c2cafdfefacddd47db532f",
      "text": "嗯。●●●●プロデューサー，\n一直以来为了我们奔波，谢谢你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_e:cmd-000098:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d0e142b97a1adce64348abbf41c13cf180efc4b3146ced7e3ff0ac1c7ed965f",
      "text": "……啊，差不多得收拾出门了。\n和你聊着天，不知不觉就忘了时间呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_e:cmd-000100:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7719735d575211bbaa2850978b5d4290e13545b04090fe3c85d039cb4b18285b",
      "text": "那么，我们在碰头的地方再见吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_f:cmd-000015:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0edfc213b2c45a845881a59b62f0d67bcfd80065792d9df654ba0c95eb6ba4a2",
      "text": "休息室",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_f:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a8d2dd9067d304ab05ae4b6586c98318e788d2dd2a5dbebd7eca875f2b5cf8f4",
      "text": "舞台准备就绪了。\n圭先生、丽先生，马上就要开演了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_f:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:12512481f1f499e6119d78d86975b56205ee9638c58f0324445116c9fb313f2d",
      "text": "知道了。我已经准备好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_f:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:644cf75eb3a2cb63e835dc970b0a34ed04fa2f5548278fab1c502bcd9630a1af",
      "text": "（……这次的演出，是仓促定下的）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_f:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4c0493c8df4bbbf120e34d584316e9c43abd4182efecb91c8cf5c0ba47360fc8",
      "text": "（想必有很多人只是碰巧路过，\n或是出于好奇才顺便过来看一眼的吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_f:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab18afe4d225e9b39fe7cfc082769229bb3a8dcd96dc85526f0b1cd509c8c3ec",
      "text": "（我对我们的音乐有信心。\n但是……果然还是会紧张）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_f:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ecdaa548191b8ecabff3c227f2912610141501063d41f3a1274a1ba83906eb5a",
      "text": "……没事的，丽先生。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_f:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0dd32d9d49231c8976bfafe53fabc686b0715df64d37fbcae54459fedea6f1f3",
      "text": "我和你只要两个人一起奏响音乐就好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_f:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c17eed8f863940b780f0de53e800a659c3f1708e05513774a03deaa65583d4a3",
      "text": "……等歌曲唱完的时候，\n这个会场一定会沉浸在欢喜之中的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_f:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8acbe5b71b4e32839ea2dfa23b49d1723989838d9bed96060a3b3a6d1fc29c0c",
      "text": "都筑先生……\n嗯，说得对呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_f:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70a9cee284769ee9b9ba54c8797ff62f34f3c68c5705f5a30cae9dd433b1db81",
      "text": "（最重要的，是顺从心之所向去歌唱）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_f:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce19da53bf829636432be6e6684e515ada49c3a0d4fbf3512d86538daae751e5",
      "text": "（我们Altessimo的音乐，\n根本没有什么好畏惧的！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_g:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:625127b2cabe4f38343c873eb9e542566f5b95566bc66090110a59124d5b74ce",
      "text": "……我们是Altessimo。首先，\n非常感谢各位来到我们的演出。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_g:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b3cb789f54164c7563cd05a2d379193208971f168714d755b5c8b322bb1df58",
      "text": "站在这里的各位，\n应该有很多人还不认识我们吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_g:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d49b1511f0e194bc92706b1ec5aead333b89606d42b749e75c53d4d739a1267",
      "text": "即使如此，依然感谢大家\n对Altessimo的音乐产生兴趣。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_g:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5a09804a8de885126f10e77a1352de8319490cbff8498b0a194419304805ec6",
      "text": "那么接下来，我们想演唱前几天发售的\n我们的新歌。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_g:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d8a7297beb45c3c8ea846d96c7dc6f039694910458e75b8f68474b289b7be31",
      "text": "……请听。《Infinite Octave》！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_g:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8cab47a2832b46ba45de04a06743f18d579e62ffb65358ff3fb391b3d6de6d26",
      "text": "哎，好像在办什么活动。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_g:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:04c6cc84047b918dc0b836a0513ef70ba44684b952fa025345a1cdca9119ba7b",
      "text": "这歌挺好听的嘛。稍微听听看吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_g:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:52f04f8bbaf482ea8c70691b100b22ecfcc73b44f005da75bc850e6aa48205ed",
      "text": "（……啊。随着歌声响起，\n人们开始陆陆续续停下脚步）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_g:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ff1b6d123a93f065d92b0f6b77f6bc03d0563b33d9607bf8c34d9b44802e1bb",
      "text": "（我的歌声……\n热爱音乐的心情，好好传达到了！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_g:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd64c56402fc72067fad4e9ea661116b330138ba218f0cb9a5835a479fe3068b",
      "text": "（丽先生的歌声变得更加舒展了。\n在我的身旁，艺术正初啼破晓……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_g:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f847c7101f845600b801af4f2fc3b33fbb7653a832d12ae1a6d8823cf4135be0",
      "text": "我们的演出到此结束。\n谢谢大家！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_g:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f05283171aaeb2538cdbe3f6697f7ee9dc69f7b694d0ab285448219a3adc4f3d",
      "text": "每首歌都好棒啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_g:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4e70b590f9eeb1d008a27da0ac47c3170156f251db3f4a69f3c52b906192357",
      "text": "呐，那边好像在卖CD。\n我去买一张过来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_h:cmd-000014:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_h:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:23a6f47edee7923cb09580edbda17d033cdfd97ea28678a9e456d321c6d322c3",
      "text": "再次祝贺，演出辛苦了！\n最后甚至盛况空前，连站席都挤满了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_h:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:11bf604782b4dd5ce3362ff8df42478e352f3354281884347575ad1e97303cba",
      "text": "这次的演出让我看到了希望。\n这世上确实有人渴望着我的乐声……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_h:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e142f33054cbc25e39a1f42b7b4397e47048d99c163e0bdecefefdd16f21270",
      "text": "对为我们准备了舞台的阁下，\n我想致以由衷的谢意。谢谢你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_h:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58d858aa8c281f5b71e733a2f0bbc4f2db122c0932475caac02349c2658f5707",
      "text": "我也想表达感谢呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_h:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:45efab1fef3593c0fc7f15fb7a932e76882a28aee7b5fabccbb05783420541c2",
      "text": "丽先生舒展歌唱的身影，\n动人得让我听得入迷。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_h:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7abe6e2ed40d75700d9d1100d16b044299a99a8e9d47d6220e9ccc1a1f549463",
      "text": "我能与丽先生相遇并创造出音乐，\n都是因为你让我成为了偶像。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_h:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c42bab13b889cf2d37b70a9d384e5dfceb59efd49b884c9d0f6b6848eb6e4d13",
      "text": "谢谢你，●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_h:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de6b22b92e6cf7e97fac55f6f4565445eb834fd347abccb8a32b32512e507d04",
      "text": "这次对于Altessimo而言，\n成了一场难以忘怀的演出。但是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_h:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe2905d38b18009594087ceadd277137f3067c0b92742650b3a958c178762e63",
      "text": "距离最终目标的顶尖偶像，\n我们恐怕反倒渐行渐远了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_h:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:abb685d5e51d81cc3538fe25b5fa26b381a6a7a00ecb365eb3142ff99877c9b3",
      "text": "毕竟原定计划是参加电视节目的。\n打乱了阁下的计划也是不争的事实……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_h:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d492dcee3f20064b26660136bad613133f2d81360e1f9b3d18cede0c4a53eb3",
      "text": "不，丽先生。在舞台上堂堂正正放声歌唱的两位，\n毫无疑问正大步迈向顶尖偶像！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_h:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:57205fa3890c554509c1d923042ddac21bc2e128e0ecc92b8a8d66b7b01fcde4",
      "text": "正因如此，Altessimo才又收到了\n这样一份崭新的工作邀约。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_h:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0a3854a62ade0d03f8e07c34b1a0b504114af934f161ceb33c19aa512f53d4de",
      "text": "……？“职场咨询活动”？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_i:cmd-000014:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d6903fc720dce3f035864ae78cabbd584b180f4a1c4d1a8f1df51c5e1d3110b",
      "text": "活动当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_i:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2f63bfb9c1bfbfdd689b6f2f1b6d23138a4d0eba34e28b0db11ed3590e8ea080",
      "text": "那么，接下来让我们欢迎今天的嘉宾，\n负责本次活动宣传的Altessimo两位成员！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_i:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c145e99b97640be74353a1101081bc5a6b2a5b8d097abcc8f685fdd786a2fce6",
      "text": "大家好。我是Altessimo的神乐丽。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_i:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cbed2312d47982376a9020b47810d6603d4ce3eac0cb40f1c765b6f91545851e",
      "text": "我是都筑圭。今天请多指教。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_i:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c6e16c750bb41f91116b00b5a8076c052015cea43f60a4750c8c65b549d9363e",
      "text": "我听说这个活动聚集了许多对工作\n怀抱各种各样烦恼的人们。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_i:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3fe11f02a1a5da9eb091e842362d6a6ef1add96bbb17adc82b6dc6448b7d4824",
      "text": "……我们是从音乐家转行成为偶像的。\n这应该算是不多见的情况吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_i:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:228949d6f6f8e6abd31132584c98c0dda4ac907e1e82374f82e579bb994080ff",
      "text": "但是，正如大家一样，\n在走向这条道路之前也经历了各种各样的挣扎。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_i:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b29325dc6947317313ef6f028006127ce8a6452943d5c52fb47bba3de1d997d9",
      "text": "也许我们说不出什么有趣的话题。而且，那个……\n用语言而非音乐去诉说，我并不是很擅长。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_i:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf5ac82c58e6bd47b1786ad1d0c7c0ba6805ab5eca400c4f3731410b0b8b0467",
      "text": "即便如此，若能对在场的各位有所帮助，我便欣慰了。\n今天请多关照。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_i:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1441c78a1385b4f78613a50ec4303b6a7eada2c7c57d7dc2fdea1a0a7fe9b43d",
      "text": "非常感谢。那么，作为两位带给大家的致辞，\n也请各位观看这段CM！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_j:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ccd17c7a90893cc31174412b4456d1b26bd42a12dc3a2e8df1283bd3a4faedf7",
      "text": "“来吧，展翅飞向全新的世界”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_j:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f331891829bff3450947e640ae02cd36362515dcf420e49d05334fa2384486b1",
      "text": "感谢各位的观看！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_j:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:476faeac703d06c250f986f5f20fd09cb43150bce7bffad24cc06576c5b04029",
      "text": "接下来，让我们进入Altessimo两位的\n提问与咨询环节。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_j:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:81dd6b797866378ffa8b6a5cde12629ed805cea2684fa13a841996dd257902b2",
      "text": "我们先来宣读事先收集到的内容。\n首先是第一个问题……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_j:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b015b0deb533eabf990274f45dcdbcccdd3983d20786463583c6a41b0b0a3a94",
      "text": "“两位一直在从事与音乐相关的工作，\n把喜欢的事情当成工作会有痛苦的时候吗？”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_j:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ac668381167f1403a1aefcc0e6946d84227a3e5ccb455add31fd25c2c3a4efa",
      "text": "当然，并非全是快乐的事。\n因音乐而起，我也曾有过痛苦的经历。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_j:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b4b31e46fe687338d459c5a66d44efde6b0ed2832850aba9a7716cf52d1de21",
      "text": "但是，即使如此……\n接触音乐的时光，依然让我感到最幸福。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_j:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d968eae35c41abd066235e9261efa90f57e737213050902f98e29668d8305992",
      "text": "而且，哪怕遭遇痛苦，\n只要有支持自己的人在，就能挺过去。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_j:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bbd9aa454d52b0e432ca7ba3b128c0415ad92e6aa013b8f45a050e0aae3475e4",
      "text": "是啊。……为了难过的时候，\n试着找找看有着相同爱好的人如何呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_j:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:03c5c79cb26c9dbaa117ffc4b0edc09ce3f41bafa675c046310551bc0f1fdabe",
      "text": "一个人或许办不到，但只要和怀抱相同梦想的人在一起，\n很多事情都能跨越过去哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_j:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b4d44aa68609a577724ec5ec5b1d899af7c627bf7252324d8b4343bc3af6de5",
      "text": "我也是正在和丽先生一起\n追逐梦想的途中……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_j:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc83727b19126eda1c41ee87cb1d71a61ef9e04004b6436db1cd0b057eb827e5",
      "text": "因为我觉得如果丽先生不在，\n我大概早就放弃一切了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_k:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:860a35b0b5ddadd6dca5a889fe6c61e9149f35b53f9630b29553e1e120907346",
      "text": "也有很多人咨询说：“正在考虑跳槽，\n但是很害怕改变现在的环境”呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_k:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd80468a3b10f1cc6d9238ba43cd6c787fdecddfdfdb230361ed4df363c3a824",
      "text": "是啊……我也曾有过\n无法向前迈出半步的灰暗日子。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_k:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ee4768cf075c93731ce810ae818566eb470075f25ef6401f022c5ffd99c79bf",
      "text": "我甚至想过保持现状就好。但是，即便如此……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_k:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96b1351b7b71e7bfaea2c4234b2ab3b832cc1baef4e31870f79ff658d76c27e1",
      "text": "我依然希望你能鼓起勇气迈出脚步。\n去挑战是有其价值的……我是这么认为的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_k:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e5c21bfa07cd20444211713516099a1de8cd53d17968817b5c7d29a3e80d9043",
      "text": "我也不擅长挑战不习惯的事物。\n所以让我们一起，一步步向前迈进吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_k:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ece51298f0361f2da6eda7bb9fd852da61c4e3aa839835b918729f7c0a2dc102",
      "text": "嗯……而且就算失败了，也没关系的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_k:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf041f405adabb2b78683cdf705d8f81af5f5d2aac559842de1e25e1c5acb399",
      "text": "只要发着呆哼着歌在外面散步，\n制作人就会……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_k:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ee58cf6a07f77b77f9edc779211548a0d516567fdb2ed54d12ba170900c1c51",
      "text": "也许就会有好心人把你捡回去，\n让你成为偶像呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_k:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:002e746ae0d34504d3f1e90fb6b8c15d49e790954826439023fb229d8adf2151",
      "text": "这、这个经历，恐怕没什么参考价值吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_k:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:50c6b7f4615a748682591b038463c8914aba18db482c9aef35e9d2de4dead278",
      "text": "诶？是这样吗～\n我还觉得是个好主意呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_k:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c900c02852046be0ad13ee304f139c511b76a32510a1a07b71bf583175f23ab5",
      "text": "我想这恐怕只适用于都筑先生一人……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_k:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d8854f21696d7ac7a4fa2c7897d7024cfef08c99bbe875e93fa0bac201fde179",
      "text": "咳咳，抱歉。\n能请您继续宣读下一条吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_k:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2a623023eb2c2559e942f875ededdda08c4cd0a0a5922a1927c137f7bd5eced",
      "text": "那么来看下一个咨询！“我分别有\n喜欢的事和想做的事”……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_k:cmd-000090:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0e7dee7459f09cce99ab9493a965de1c45f77d1ae28531c2a551de6cf7ef221",
      "text": "当晚……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_k:cmd-000093:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29e7767e7920fe24e3b94b781b719c2e109c5ccf4e6e887c31792db9a1b6c819",
      "text": "今天的宣传活动\n辛苦两位了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_k:cmd-000096:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:858b216a48ecf276795a85d5ac8407caf17d9cba1272f4b97df6fda0a964fd7d",
      "text": "辛苦了",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_k:cmd-000098:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:729fb0d5057b10c486366540ca933e82b83ea80b0d4a144fe96ce43dec9e884d",
      "text": "很久没有和\n那么多人说过话了呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_k:cmd-000100:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2d2b4feef95e2f618c3d6b390d4d51b8e581e5a9aba43dbe96d11538f9527e4f",
      "text": "我也是。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_k:cmd-000102:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7649f738e0570834da1b0d8f6943dbe84a08e160eceec68863c80aec6d77b696",
      "text": "感觉在那场活动上，\n把一辈子的份都说完了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_k:cmd-000104:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1acf26a07afa6195d2b4cb9eda1b20663b19dd1a95fe8c30d14dc846e1dab70c",
      "text": "嗯\n现在\n非常困",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_k:cmd-000106:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:583cb7a4c44435c51bcd5a53620b4ba9ca57ca34002239b30d0dc2bfc2ced587",
      "text": "虽然很不容易，但我们的话语\n若能成为大家拿出勇气的契机，\n就太令人欣慰了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_k:cmd-000108:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f4186ee8fe1358ee76dc58580b85d55a16dc647533c1fcab07f1da8e754ca53",
      "text": "都筑先生在活动结束后\n感觉如何呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_k:cmd-000110:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d19fd2d654cbe66fd1ef20be4368f24c8fdbb981a62143a71214d555de6b13ae",
      "text": "都筑先生？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_k:cmd-000112:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8860cb33ed7bdcf911e25a4d0b3f4e4a2b901c64733d03b96dc7e2e8f46db5cc",
      "text": "可能是睡着了",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_k:cmd-000112:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef15f71caa1d8274cbb34e730bd7b27352611f05d32bdf86c6fbf587b3549547",
      "text": "可能是睡着了\n吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_k:cmd-000113:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1166c3a245f0c71aec542ac79d27afded4fe56e1eafda501f94987d32bd54419",
      "text": "打电话吵醒他\n挺过意不去的呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_k:cmd-000113:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:74c5f469ce98698478e0a9b0a2237d2ddce2091a984286176456cf51cf5dfb79",
      "text": "是睡着了吗？\n打电话吵醒他的话，\n挺过意不去的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_k:cmd-000117:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:26899342786d6df2a77c56457784b76994000c3cbce301df6acad2543bf40dde",
      "text": "说得对。\n今天就聊到这里吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_k:cmd-000119:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b0432ec4c955880d846e66f712e926eb8ac4715197a42faee709b645211471d",
      "text": "晚安，都筑先生。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
